# Character classes matter: .gitignore is case-sensitive, and writing
# `**/*token*` allowed API_TOKEN.txt or Secret.json through. Verified with
# `git check-ignore -v`.
**/*[Tt][Oo][Kk][Ee][Nn]*
**/*[Ss][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]*
